<title>SWITZERLAND: SNB leaves discount rate unchanged at 1.00 pct.</title>
<headline>SNB leaves discount rate unchanged at 1.00 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Swiss National Bank (SNB) said it left its discount rate unchanged at 1.00 percent after a regular weekly meeting of its three-member board.</p>
<p>&quot;No change,&quot; said a spokesman for the SNB.</p>
<p>The SNB last lowered the rate from 1.50 percent on September 26. No change in policy was expected at today's meeting.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial, +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
